        <div class="lab-panel"><div class="lab-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">LIVE EXPERIMENT / 完整网络计算</div><h3 id="lab-title">主食</h3></div><button id="lab-reset" class="button small-button">全网络恢复中性</button></div><div class="mode-selector" role="group" aria-label="替代方案"><button data-mode="A" class="active">A · 旧式价格响应 <span>推荐候选</span></button><button data-mode="B">B · 组预算守恒 <span>新增玩法</span></button></div><div id="mode-description" class="lab-explainer"></div><div class="preset-row"><span>快速试验</span><button data-preset="shock">首件变贵</button><button data-preset="unequal">90 / 10 不等基线</button><button data-preset="missing">缺接口 / 无供应</button><button data-preset="overlap">葡萄酒跨两组</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="lab-table"><thead><tr><th>商品 / 所属组</th><th>价格比 r</th><th>基线金额 B</th><th>供给</th><th>接口</th><th>权重 T</th><th>最终 D</th><th>目标金额</th></tr></thead><tbody id="lab-rows"></tbody></table></div><div id="lab-summary" class="lab-summary" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="lab-bottom"><div id="lab-formula" class="formula"></div><button id="lab-export" class="button small-button">导出全商品 CSV ↓</button></div></div>
